# Model files (Models/<export>/, e.g. rpm/): each version's ONNX graph and
# reference output in models/<name>/output_ref/, and the captures in data/, are
# git-ignored with their .meta files and travel in the projects' local-files zip.
# The READMEs, each version's manifest.json and Models/model_fingerprint.txt
# (Tools~/model_fingerprint.py) stay tracked, so ModelFingerprintTests can tell
# whether the local models match the commit.
/Models/*/models/*/*.onnx
/Models/*/models/*/*.onnx.meta
/Models/*/models/*/output_ref/
/Models/*/models/*/output_ref.meta
/Models/*/data/
/Models/*/data.meta

# Audio2Face native plugin build tree (Tools~/audio2face_plugin.py build).
/Native~/Audio2FacePlugin/build/

__pycache__/
